Type: Package
Package: SLPresElection
Title: Presidential Election Data of "Sri Lanka" from 1982 to 2019
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Amalan", "Mahendran", , "amalan0595@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0643-9052"))
Description: Provides Sri Lankan presidential election results for
    1982, 1988, 1994, 1999, 2005, 2010, 2015, and 2019. The datasets
    contain candidate vote counts, reported percentages, and summary
    statistics for polling divisions and district results, including
    postal and displaced votes where available. Results were extracted
    from PDF documents and prepared in a consistent tabular format.
